<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 17.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on January 17:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		 Ship	  Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General	    837/--- (LDD)   166/---  Blue Jade	 15/01</p>
<p>General	    116/--- (LDD)   532/---  Hpa-An	    13/01</p>
<p>Sugar		488/--- (LDD) 1,138/---  Hyoksin	   14/01</p>
<p>Urea	    21,841/--- (ULD) 1,660/---  Jag Vasanthy    06/01</p>
<p>HB Iron	  1,100/--- (ULD) 1,368/---  Neerja	    15/01</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - To Load</p>
<p>	    ULD - To Unload</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
